[h2]Build 0.9.134[/h2]
[h3]Fixed[/h3]
[list]
[*]Gear whose cost is only given by a separate crafting recipe - such as Vanilla Apparel Expanded's quiver (30 leather and 15 wood) - was treated as made of nothing: it could not be recycled ("cannot be recycled") and was repaired for free. The mod now reads the recipe that makes such an item, so it recycles into its real materials and repairs cost what they should. This applies to the benches and the industrial repair center alike.
[/list]
